OL,3,GNEWSAThe health service offering check
OL,4,Aups at check out
OL,5,
OL,6,FAutomatic health check machines are
OL,7,Fbeing installed at six public points -
OL,8,Fincluding libraries and supermarkets -
OL,9,Facross Norfolk.
OL,11,FThe equipment, which measures BMI, body
OL,12,Ffat and blood pressure, offers
OL,13,Flifestyle advice and can signpost
OL,14,Fpeople to see a pharmacist or GP if
OL,15,Fthey have worrying results.
OL,17,FNorwich, King's Lynn, Great Yarmouth,
OL,18,FGorleston and North Walsham have been
OL,19,Fchosen because they have higher levels
OL,20,Fof deprivation associated with cardiac
OL,21,Frisk.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
